WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.140
She didn't fall in love with you because you
remembered her birthday and bought her flowers

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:07.500
on Valentine's Day.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.750
She fell in love with you because when you
woke up in the morning you said, "good morning"'

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.420
to her before you checked your phone.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:16.950
She fell in love with you because when you
went to the fridge to get yourself a drink,

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.240
you got her one without even asking.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:23.090
She fell in love with you because when you
had an amazing day at work and she came home

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:26.519
and she had a terrible day at work, you didn't
say "yeah, yeah, yeah but let me tell you

00:00:26.519 --> 00:00:27.770
about my day."

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:31.500
You sat and listened to her awful day and
you didn't say a thing about

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.890
your amazing day.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:34.310
This is why she fell in love with you.

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:38.870
I can't tell you exactly what day and it was
no particular thing you did.

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:41.782
It was the accumulation of all of 
those little things,

00:00:41.782 --> 00:00:43.670
that she woke up one days and as if

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:47.559
she pressed a button she goes, "I love him."

00:00:47.559 --> 00:00:50.440
And the same with the relationship, it's not
about the events.

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:53.160
It's not about intensity, it's about consistency.

